Here's a MATLAB function that converts a given phrase to its Morse Code representation using the provided Morse Code representation table:

```matlab
function morse_code = encode_morse(phrase)
    % Convert input phrase to uppercase
    phrase = upper(phrase);

    % Initialize output string
    morse_code = '';

    % Loop through each character in the phrase
    for i = 1:length(phrase)
        % Get the Morse Code representation of the current character
        morserep = lookup(phrase(i), 'Character', 'Morse Code');

        % Add the Morse Code representation to the output string
        morse_code = [morse_code, morserep];
    end
end
```

